        {
          "text": "Lino kwakasika bana basimbi ba-Zelofehadi mwana wa-Heferi mwana wa-Gileadi mwana wa-Makiri mwana wa-Manase, bamusyobo wa­ Manase mwana wa-Josefa, Ngaaya mazina aabana bakwe basimbi: Mala, Nowa, Hogila, Milika a-Tiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
